These bundled font files are static instances of the official Noto Sans variable
fonts from the Google Fonts repository. The repository's SIL Open Font License
(OFL) notices for each family are included beside the fonts:

- Noto Sans: NotoSans-OFL.txt
- Noto Sans Kannada: NotoSansKannada-OFL.txt
- Noto Sans Devanagari: NotoSansDevanagari-OFL.txt
- Noto Sans Telugu: NotoSansTelugu-OFL.txt
- Noto Sans Tamil: NotoSansTamil-OFL.txt

Official sources:
- https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosans
- https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanskannada
- https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosansdevanagari
- https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanstelugu
- https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanstamil
